How Gizmo works
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

With Gizmo you'll soon be able to learn and remember more than you ever tho=
ught possible. Here are some tips help you get started.=C2=A0

###**=F0=9F=A4=B3 Download the app**

Use Gizmo wherever you are with the mobile app.=C2=A0


###**=F0=9F=91=A8=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=92=BB Make cards from anything you want to=
 remember=C2=A0**

Make cards for anything you want to remember. You can use Gizmo to remember=
 anything: an interesting fact from a podcast, a friend's birthday, or what=
ever you are studying right now. You can also add **images** =F0=9F=93=B7 t=
o Gizmo cards, just click on the image icon on the add page.=C2=A0

###**=F0=9F=A4=96 Import from Quizlet, Youtube, Notes, and more**

With Gizmo, you can import cards from pretty much anywhere. Just click on M=
agic Import. Gizmo's AI will turn whatever you upload into quizzes!

**=F0=9F=A7=99=E2=80=8D=E2=99=82=EF=B8=8F Gizmo turns cards into quizzes us=
ing AI**

Gizmo makes it easy to create cards. Just type in a sentence like =E2=80=9C=
The Capital of **Peru** is **Lima**=E2=80=9D and Gizmo will turn it into a =
quiz. Gizmo's AI selects the words that it will quiz you on. If you don't w=
ant to be quizzed on certain words you can simply click on the **green** **=
words** to unhighlight them.

**=F0=9F=91=A9=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=8E=93 Spend a few minutes quizzing=C2=A0**

Come back to Gizmo whenever you have a few minutes to complete your quizzes=
. Gizmo's algorithm tests you in a way that is most efficient for your memo=
ry. By answering quizzes often, information gets reinforced in your memory =
so that you=E2=80=99ll remember it over the long term.

**=F0=9F=86=98 Need some help?**

Email [paul@gizmo.ai](mailto:paul@gizmo.ai) or join our [Discord](https://d=
iscord.gg/TMubeSxKQm) to ask any questions and request improvements.

